 8.65332C12.4147 6.75934 11.8059 5.18505 9.90918 4.41016Z" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.64"></path></svg><h2 class="text-title-h5 text-accent-black">Pay-as-you-go</h2></div><p class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-72 mb-24 max-w-2xl">Keep accessing web data with search and scrape when your credits run out. We add credits in 5 USD increments, up to a monthly limit you set. Paid plans only.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-6 text-label-medium text-heat-100 hover:text-heat-100/80 transition-colors" href="/signin?view=signup">Enable pay-as-you-go <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="relative -mt-1 flex justify-center p-15 before:inside-border before:border-border-faint before:!border-x-0"><div class="overlay pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] curvy-rect"><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="-rotate-90 absolute top-0 left-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="absolute top-0 right-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="rotate-180 absolute bottom-0 left-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="rotate-90 absolute bottom-0 right-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg></div><a class="flex w-fit items-center gap-4 text-label-medium text-black-alpha-48 transition-opacity hover:opacity-80" href="/pricing.md">View pricing as Markdown<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></section><section id="pricing-at-a-glance" class="container relative -mt-1 scroll-mt-24 px-32 lg:px-64 py-24 lg:py-40"><div class="overlay pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] curvy-rect"><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="-rotate-90 absolute top-0 left-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="absolute top-0 right-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="rotate-180 absolute bottom-0 left-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="rotate-90 absolute bottom-0 right-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg></div><h2 class="text-title-h5 text-accent-black">Pricing at a<span class="text-title-h5 text-heat-100"> glance</span></h2><dl class="mt-16 flex flex-col gap-12"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 lg:flex-row lg:gap-16"><dt class="text-body-large text-accent-black lg:w-192 lg:shrink-0">Credit unit</dt><dd class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-88">1 credit = 1 page on a basic scrape, crawl, or map. Search costs 2 credits per 10 results; Interact costs 2 credits per browser minute. On Scrape and Crawl, the JSON, Question, and Highlight formats add 4 credits per page; Monitor&#x27;s deterministic-extraction engine bills a flat 7 credits per page per check instead. Credits are shared across all endpoints: search results and pages scraped draw on one balance.</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 lg:flex-row lg:gap-16"><dt class="text-body-large text-accent-black lg:w-192 lg:shrink-0">Free tier</dt><dd class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-88">1,000 credits every month, refreshed monthly, no credit card required.</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 lg:flex-row lg:gap-16"><dt class="text-body-large text-accent-black lg:w-192 lg:shrink-0">Entry plan</dt><dd class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-88">Hobby: $19/month billed monthly, or $16/month billed annually, for 5,000 credits per month (2,500 searches or 5,000 pages scraped).</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 lg:flex-row lg:gap-16"><dt class="text-body-large text-accent-black lg:w-192 lg:shrink-0">Failed requests</dt><dd class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-88">A scrape that returns no result is not charged. A page that responds with an error status such as 403 or 404 is still returned to you and costs 1 credit.</dd></div></dl><p class="mt-16 text-body-medium text-black-alpha-48">Effective <!-- -->September 4, 2026<!-- -->. Prices in USD.</p></section><div class="h-84 relative -mt-1 container"><div class="h-1 top-0 absolute w-screen left-[calc(50%-50vw)] bg-border-faint"></div><div class="h-1 bottom-0 absolute w-screen left-[calc(50%-50vw)] bg-border-faint"></div><svg fill="none" height="21" viewBox="0 0 22 21" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] absolute absolute -right-[10.5px] -top-10"><path d="M10.5 4C10.5 7.31371 7.81371 10 4.5 10H0.5V11H4.5C7.81371 11 10.5 13.6863 10.5 17V21H11.5V17C11.5 13.6863 14.1863 11 17.5 11H21.5V10H17.5C14.1863 10 11.5 7.31371 11.5 4V0H10.5V4Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="21" viewBox="0 0 22 21" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] absolute absolute -left-[10.5px] -top-10"><path d="M10.5 4C10.5 7.31371 7.81371 10 4.5 10H0.5V11H4.5C7.81371 11 10.5 13.6863 10.5 17V21H11.5V17C11.5 13.6863 14.1863 11 17.5 11H21.5V10H17.5C14.1863 10 11.5 7.31371 11.5 4V0H10.5V4Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="21" viewBox="0 0 22 21" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] absolute absolute -right-[10.5px] -bottom-10"><path d="M10.5 4C10.5 7.31371 7.81371 10 4.5 10H0.5V11H4.5C7.81371 11 10.5 13.6863 10.5 17V21H11.5V17C11.5 13.6863 14.1863 11 17.5 11H21.5V10H17.5C14.1863 10 11.5 7.31371 11.5 4V0H10.5V4Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="21" viewBox="0 0 22 21" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] absolute absolute -left-[10.5px] -bottom-10"><path d="M10.5 4C10.5 7.31371 7.81371 10 4.5 10H0.5V11H4.5C7.81371 11 10.5 13.6863 10.5 17V21H11.5V17C11.5 13.6863 14.1863 11 17.5 11H21.5V10H17.5C14.1863 10 11.5 7.31371 11.5 4V0H10.5V4Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg></div><section id="credits" class="lg:grid container grid-cols-2 relative -mt-1 scroll-mt-24"><div class="overlay pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] curvy-rect"><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="-rotate-90 absolute top-0 left-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="absolute top-0 right-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="rotate-180 absolute bottom-0 left-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="rotate-90 absolute bottom-0 right-0"><path d="M11 1L11 11L10 11L10 7C10 3.68629 7.31371 1 4 1L-4.37114e-08 1L0 -4.80825e-07L11 4.37114e-07L11 1Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg></div><div class="px-32 lg:px-64 py-24 lg:py-56 flex flex-col gap-16 before:inside-border-x before:border-border-faint border-b border-border-faint relative"><h2 class="text-title-h5 text-accent-black">API<span class="text-title-h5 text-heat-100"> Credits</span></h2><div class="text-body-large text-black-alpha-88 max-w-358">Credits are consumed for each API request, varying by endpoint and feature. These rates are the same on every plan.</div><svg fill="none" height="21" viewBox="0 0 22 21" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] absolute absolute -right-[10.5px] -bottom-11"><path d="M10.5 4C10.5 7.31371 7.81371 10 4.5 10H0.5V11H4.5C7.81371 11 10.5 13.6863 10.5 17V21H11.5V17C11.5 13.6863 14.1863 11 17.5 11H21.5V10H17.5C14.1863 10 11.5 7.31371 11.5 4V0H10.5V4Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg></div><div class="flex-1 lg-max:hidden"></div><div class="flex-1 lg-max:hidden"></div><div><div class="text-body-medium text-black-alpha-64 flex py-18 px-24 before:inside-border before:border-border-faint relative -mt-1 lg:-ml-1"><div class="flex-1 pr-20 lg:pr-24">Features</div><div class="w-124 lg:w-190">Credits</div><div class="w-18"></div></div><div data-section="scrape"><div class="border border-t-0 border-border-faint relative -mt-1 lg:-ml-1 group"><div class="flex items-center px-24 w-full cursor-pointer"><div class="flex items-center gap-12 py-24 flex-1"><canvas class="" style="width:20px;height:20px"></canvas><div class="text-body-medium text-accent-black">Scrape</div></div><div class="text-body-medium text-accent-black w-124 lg:w-190">1<span class="text-body-medium text-black-alpha-48 ml-8"> / page</span></div><div><svg fill="none" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" class="rotate-180 text-accent-black" width="18" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M6 10.5L9 7.5L12 10.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-opacity="0.56" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div><div class="border border-t-0 border-border-faint relative -mt-1 lg:-ml-1 group"><div class="flex items-center px-24 w-full cursor-pointer"><div class="flex items-center gap-12 py-24 flex-1"><canvas class="" style="width:20px;height:20px"></canvas><div class="text-body-medium text-accent-black">Crawl</div></div><div class="text-body-medium text-accent-black w-124 lg:w-190">1<span class="text-body-medium text-black-alpha-48 ml-8"> / page</span></div><div><svg fill="none" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" class="rotate-180 text-accent-black" width="18" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M6 10.5L9 7.5L12 10.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-opacity="0.56" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div><div class="border border-t-0 border-border-faint relative -mt-1 lg:-ml-1 group"><div class="flex items-center px-24 w-full"><div class="flex items-center gap-12 py-24 flex-1"><canvas class="" style="width:20px;height:20px"></canvas><div class="text-body-medium text-accent-black">Map</div></div><div class="text-body-medium text-accent-black w-124 lg:w-190">1<span class="text-body-medium text-black-alpha-48 ml-8">/ page</span></div><div class="!w-18"></div></div></div></div><div><div class="border border-t-0 border-border-faint relative -mt-1 lg:-ml-1 group"><div class="flex items-center px-24 w-full cursor-pointer"><div class="flex items-center gap-12 py-24 flex-1"><canvas style="width:20px;height:20px" class=""></canvas><div class="text-body-medium text-accent-black">Search</div></div><div class="text-body-medium text-accent-black w-124 lg:w-190">2<span class="text-body-medium text-black-alpha-48 ml-8">/ 10 results</span></div><div><svg fill="none" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" class="rotate-180 text-accent-black" width="18" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M6 10.5L9 7.5L12 10.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-opacity="0.56" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div><div class="border border-t-0 border-border-faint relative -mt-1 lg:-ml-1 group"><div class="flex items-center px-24 w-full"><div class="flex items-center gap-12 py-24 flex-1"><canvas class="" style="width:20px;height:20px"></canvas><div class="text-body-medium text-accent-black">Interact</div></div><div class="text-body-medium text-accent-black w-124 lg:w-190">2<span class="text-body-medium text-black-alpha-48 ml-8">/ browser minute</span></div><div class="!w-18"></div></div></div></div><div><div class="border border-t-0 border-border-faint relative -mt-1 lg:-ml-1 group"><div class="flex items-center px-24 w-full cursor-pointer"><div class="flex items-center gap-12 py-24 flex-1"><canvas class="" style="width:20px;height:20px"></canvas><div class="text-body-medium text-accent-black">Monitor</div></div><div class="text-body-medium text-accent-black w-124 lg:w-190">1<span class="text-body-medium text-black-alpha-48 ml-8">/ page / check</span></div><div><svg fill="none" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" class="rotate-180 text-accent-black" width="18" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M6 10.5L9 7.5L12 10.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-opacity="0.56" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div><div class="border border-t-0 border-border-faint relative -mt-1 lg:-ml-1 group"><div class="flex items-center px-24 w-full cursor-pointer"><div class="flex items-center gap-12 py-24 flex-1"><canvas class="" style="width:20px;height:20px"></canvas><div class="text-body-medium text-accent-black">Agent (Preview)</div></div><div class="text-body-medium text-accent-black w-124 lg:w-190">5 daily runs free. <br/> <span class="text-body-medium text-black-alpha-48">Dynamic pricing</span></div><div><svg fill="none" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" class="rotate-180 text-accent-black" width="18" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M6 10.5L9 7.5L12 10.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-opacity="0.56" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="-mt-1 pointer-events-none select-none relative"><svg fill="none" height="21" viewBox="0 0 22 21" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] absolute absolute right-[-10.5px] -top-10"><path d="M10.5 4C10.5 7.31371 7.81371 10 4.5 10H0.5V11H4.5C7.81371 11 10.5 13.6863 10.5 17V21H11.5V17C11.5 13.6863 14.1863 11 17.5 11H21.5V10H17.5C14.1863 10 11.5 7.31371 11.5 4V0H10.5V4Z" fill="var(--border-faint)"></path></svg><svg fill="none" height="21" viewBox="0 0 22 21" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="pointer-events-none contain-[layout,paint] absolute absolute left-[-10.5px] -top-10"><path d="M10.5 4C10.5 7.31371 7.81371 10 4.5 10H0.5V11H4.5C7.81371 11 10.5 13.6863 10.5 17V21H11.5V17C11.5 13.